			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Rikoru",
					"Paimon"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 722450101,
					"content": "What? Don't disturb me. I'm thinking...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722450102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Rikoru"
				},
				{
					"id": 722450102,
					"content": "Yes, I'm thinking about something very important!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722450103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Rikoru"
				},
				{
					"id": 722450103,
					"content": "What is it?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722450104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 722450104,
					"content": "Have you seen that thing they call the Dainichi Mikoshi?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722450105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Rikoru"
				},
				{
					"id": 722450105,
					"content": "The tallest thing in the whole country.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722450106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Rikoru"
				},
				{
					"id": 722450106,
					"content": "I was thinking about how I can build something even taller than that!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722450107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Rikoru"
				},
				{
					"id": 722450107,
					"content": "But it's only so tall so that it can light up Byakuyakoku, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722450108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 722450108,
					"content": "What's the reason for your building being so tall?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722450109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 722450109,
					"content": "To display my glory, of course! The glory of Rikoru the Great!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722450110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Rikoru"
				},
				{
					"id": 722450110,
					"content": "That'll show that old man Aberaku who's boss!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722450111,
						722450112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Rikoru"
				},
				{
					"id": 722450111,
					"content": "You know...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722450113
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722450113,
					"content": "Of course. He built the Dainichi Mikoshi and saved Byakuyakoku. I used to look up to him...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722450114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Rikoru"
				},
				{
					"id": 722450114,
					"content": "But as it turned out, he had designs on the throne. If it wasn't for those adults, I would be dead right now.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722450115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Rikoru"
				},
				{
					"id": 722450115,
					"content": "That's why I will build something taller than the Dainichi Mikoshi.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722450116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Rikoru"
				},
				{
					"id": 722450116,
					"content": "H—How long will that take?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722450117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 722450117,
					"content": "Like I care!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722450118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Rikoru"
				},
				{
					"id": 722450118,
					"content": "The people of Byakuyakoku should be happy that I would ask them to build such a historical wonder for me!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722450119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Rikoru"
				},
				{
					"id": 722450119,
					"content": "Alright, then! Stop bothering me!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722450120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Rikoru"
				},
				{
					"id": 722450120,
					"content": "Let me think. If the beams are this long... If we do it that way, the load-bearing and wood joinery...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Rikoru"
				},
				{
					"id": 722450112,
					"content": "Aberaku?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722450113
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7224502,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7224502
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7224502",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7224502,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Isumenasu",
					"Paimon"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 722450201,
					"content": "Hmm? I've never seen people dressed like you are before.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722450202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Isumenasu"
				},
				{
					"id": 722450202,
					"content": "Are you someone who fell from... that, uh, from beyond the skies?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722450203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Isumenasu"
				},
				{
					"id": 722450203,
					"content": "So! The world does not end with our glorious nation! Well, then. Surrender your maps to me for my perusal.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722450204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Isumenasu"
				},
				{
					"id": 722450204,
					"content": "(You give him your map...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722450205
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722450205,
					"content": "Ah, how very intricate. Not only are the landforms accurately drawn, but even the paths of the mountains and rivers can be seen.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722450206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Isumenasu"
				},
				{
					"id": 722450206,
					"content": "Well, then. How large is this nation you call \"Teyvat\"? How does it measure up to Byakuyakoku?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722450207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Isumenasu"
				},
				{
					"id": 722450207,
					"content": "Teyvat's a whole continent...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722450208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 722450208,
					"content": "Also, Enkanomiya... That is, Byakuyakoku, is this small patch on the south end of the map.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722450209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 722450209,
					"content": "Nonsense! Our lands are vast and broad! How can they occupy but such a puny space?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722450210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Isumenasu"
				},
				{
					"id": 722450210,
					"content": "This map may seem exquisitely drawn, but is in truth an errant fraud. Away, away with it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722450211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Isumenasu"
				},
				{
					"id": 722450211,
					"content": "To think I had even a moment of admiration for this cheap charlatanry, to the defilement of mine eyes!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722450212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Isumenasu"
				},
				{
					"id": 722450212,
					"content": "Well, suit yourself, kiddo!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7224503,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7224503
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
